# Anything pulled off a disc image. Never commit these: they are the game's own files,
# not the converted models under models/. You generate this directory yourself by
# following docs/START_HERE.md.
/extracted/

# Ghidra project: it contains the game's executable and code.
/ghidra/

# Raw decompiler output: a mechanical translation of the game's code. Regenerate it with
# tools/GhidraScripts/ instead. See NOTICE.md.
/notes/decomp*/

# Superseded export generations. Regenerable, and large.
/models/archive/

# Local tooling
.claude/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
